CardDescriptionm = "*Relic Requirement: \"Bell Bearer\"* When this Relic is attached to an Adventurer in your Party, heal all Damage from your Party. Once during your turn, you may distribute 6 Buff Counters among your Party in any way you like. These Buff Counters expire at the next End Step, or if this Relic's effect is negated."
